   "note": "ONE MODULE CARRIES ELEVEN RATINGS AS A FIELD. The datasheet sells breakers from 2 A to 60 A as eleven part numbers that differ in nothing but the figure printed on the handle, so they are one part with a `rating` field, set per position in a configuration. Each breaker ships with a touch guard seated on it, a separate part that a configuration can take off. The populated example is an invented load to show the field working; the vendor publishes no standard fill."
